    "body": "## Motivation\n\n`test/registered/unit/mem_cache/test_hicache_nixl_storage.py` is flaky on shared CI runners. `TestNixlUnified` and `TestNixlDirectIO` write to the fixed directories `/tmp/test_nixl_unified` and `/tmp/test_nixl_direct_io` and remove them in `tearDown`. When two jobs run on the same host, one job's `tearDown` deletes the other's files mid-test, and NIXL's POSIX registration fails, e.g. in `base-b-test-1-gpu-small (5)` on #44533:\n\n```\nPOSIX path-mode open failed: nixl::FileFd(\"/tmp/test_nixl_unified/72/same_prefix_False_test_model_0_2_mamba\"): No such file or directory\nFAIL: test_mla_mamba_round_trip_keeps_each_tp_rank (zero_copy=False)\nAssertionError: Lists differ: [False] != [True]\n```\n\n## Modifications\n\nBoth test classes now create their own directory with `tempfile.mkdtemp` in `setUp` (the existing `tearDown` still removes it). No product code changes.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `test_hicache_nixl_storage.py`, whole file, 3 runs: 23 passed, 1 skipped (minio unavailable) each time.\n- Concurrency repro, `TestNixlUnified` with 4 copies running at once, 3 rounds: on main 8 of 12 runs fail with the error above; with this change 12 of 12 pass.\n- `black`, `isort`, `ruff check --select=F401,F821,F823,UP037` clean on the changed file.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #38830249185](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38830249185)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38830249212](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38830249212)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38830249166](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38830249166)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
